  "instructions": [
    "Preheat your terracotta dish in the oven to 350°F (175°C).",
    "In a large bowl, combine oats and honey. Stir in melted coconut oil.",
    "Add salt, flaxseed, almond milk, score-fat, and cinnamon. Mix well until smooth and thick.",
    "Pour mixture into preheated terracotta dish and bake for 20-25 minutes or until golden brown.",
    "Serve warm with a side of fresh fruit or a drizzle of honey."
